0 FILE cute-esp32-lego-car.ldr
0 Name: Cute Pastel LEGO Style ESP32 4WD Smart Robot Car (20x16 Studs)
0 Author: Antigravity Engineering CAD System
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under CCAL version 2.0
0 // ==========================================================================
0 // LDraw Coordinate System Conversion (1 LDU = 0.4mm, 1 Stud = 20 LDU):
0 //   X_ldraw : Width  (-160 LDU to +160 LDU = 16 Studs = 128mm)
0 //   Z_ldraw : Length (-200 LDU to +200 LDU = 20 Studs = 160mm, +Z = Front)
0 //   Y_ldraw : Height (0 = Deck Base Z=12mm, negative Y is UP, 1 Brick = -24 LDU)
0 // Colors:
0 //   226 = Bright Light Yellow (Cream Yellow Body)
0 //   37  = Medium Green / Mint Green (Macaron Accent & Roof Louvers)
0 //   15  = White (Cream White Front & Rear Bumpers)
0 //   29  = Bright Pink (Cute Cheek Blush & Dual Mic Ports)
0 //   72  = Dark Bluish Gray (OLED Eye Windshield Frame)
0 // ==========================================================================

0 STEP
0 // --- LAYER 1 (Y = -24 LDU): Technic Base Bricks & Milk-White Bumpers ---
0 // Left & Right Middle Technic 1x6 Bricks (3894.dat) bolted to Lower Acrylic Deck
1 226 -150 -24 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 -1 0 0 3894.dat
